# Everything the launchers mount into their containers: models, ComfyUI
# outputs and custom nodes, MIOpen's per-machine databases and caches, the
# workspace (datasets, training runs, LoRA output) and Ollama's models. All of
# it is per-user, large, or both.
/ComfyUI/
/ollama/
/miopen/
/workspace/

# Build logs written by setup.sh
/setup-logs/

# Model weights, latent caches and other per-user data, wherever they land
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.gguf
*.npz

# Python environments and bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# Editor and agent state, per-machine output of the host tools, local notes
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
.claude/
/gpu_monitor.log
/CLAUDE.local.md
